    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Cottage on 1 acre.\r\nGreat opportunity to acquire an old residence with such potential. \r\nThis 2 bedroomed cottage is in good condition and is sitting on a fantastic site of 0.42 Hectares / 1.038 Acres.\r\nWonderful opportunity to extend / improve the existing cottage, OR replace it with another statement house. Maybe even put a second house on it!\r\nHow good is your imagination?\r\nIn this Prime, but yet low density residential area. Sites are impossible to get in this area. Avoids Local Needs restrictions.\r\nSuperb gardens with south facing rear views. \r\nThe cottage is very livable having a Livingroom extension and improvements. There is a selection of sheds to the rear. \r\nIts location is super. ¾ km from Shop, Take Away, Doctors in Donacarney. 1km from Primary School in Donacarney. 10 minutes to M1 motorway and to Drogheda town.\r\nGolf, Beach, Tennis, Grammer & Secondary Schools, Train are all with 10 minutes.\r\n\r\nThe cottage is in good condition. It’s layout has been altered with a rear extension. It is very much  orientated to the rear garden that is south facing. This gives it a very private and bright outlook. The driveway leads to the rear of the house and gardens that are well planted. Shed to the side. \r\nFurther to the rear is a large Shed with 8 dog kennels. A portion of the rear is not landscaped.\r\n\r\nServices:\r\nSeptic Tank sewerage. Mains Water.\r\nMains Gas Central heating. PVC & Teak Double Glazing."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The House contains 70m2:\r\nKitchen: tiled floor. Stove.\r\nLiving Rm / Sun Room: Bright, Stove.\r\nUtility.\r\nBed 1.\r\nInner Hall.\r\nBathroom: Walk in Shower.\r\nBedroom 2."
      },
